{"root":{"data":{"id":"dhhnafxbg4w0","created":1775029066529,"text":"随身携带样品"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhnau0zuwo0","created":1775029097227,"text":"（1）炭化温度-1","note":"新-？？？\n实际温度=设定温度-89℃\neg：850℃（set）=761℃\n这应该是第二次系统做炭化条件的\n也就是现存的第一批料\n原料是未处理的竹\n第一次的料可能是淹没销毁了？？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhncxwk07s0","created":1775029262394,"text":"761℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnd1rh7cw0","created":1775029270794,"text":"961℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnd26fuzk0","created":1775029271698,"text":"1161℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhncz6cfyg0","created":1775029265162,"text":"1361℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhncz9njog0","created":1775029265362,"text":"1561℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnczcksag0","created":1775029265539,"text":"1500-1","note":"后面为了好看可能就把实际温度+39\neg：761℃当作了800℃\n这里的1500应该是实际温度1461℃\n是这一组实验里的非均匀点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnho7pa0g0","created":1775029633121,"text":"1500-2"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnava93bs0","created":1775029099963,"text":"（2）炭化温度-2","note":"这组可能是淹没后第二次系统做炭化温度\n但也可能是第一次\n统一是没有标签，用黑色马克笔直接标注在袋子上的\n所以可能是在学校的时候有一搭无一搭地做的\n时间可能在（1）炭化温度-1之前\n标注格式例如：985℃-2h-5Cpm\n不晓得温度是实际温度还是设定温度\n后面为了好看可能是都+15℃\neg：985℃当作1000℃\n同样是有非均匀点，不知道为什么总是这样\n原料应该也是没处理的竹\n？？？\n但也可能是竹颗粒，很大可能\n不不拿着就是第三次系统做炭化条件的\n第二次k"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhnm6xkteg0","created":1775029987324,"text":"未加热（通氩气）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmc3xm3k0","created":1775029998592,"text":"985℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmc74o5s0","created":1775029998785,"text":"1185℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcap5w00","created":1775029999001,"text":"1285℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcdh9ig0","created":1775029999169,"text":"1385℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcgrxh40","created":1775029999369,"text":"1485℃"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcj0wmw0","created":1775029999505,"text":"1585℃"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnavj4ag00","created":1775029100499,"text":"（4）葡萄糖包覆量","layout_mind_offset":{"x":56,"y":32},"note":"点又不均匀，为什么老这样\n并且根据标号，很确定是故意少了2%？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhny6tp8740","created":1775030927459,"text":"1%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7az1jc0","created":1775030928504,"text":"1.5%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7etcjc0","created":1775030928736,"text":"2.5%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7hzfoo0","created":1775030928928,"text":"3%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7l52z40","created":1775030929119,"text":"4%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhny7o7q2o0","created":1775030929304,"text":"无包覆（排除球磨影响）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnavqi6ns0","created":1775029100946,"text":"（3）升温速率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnavx45lc0","created":1775029101346,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnaw588800","created":1775029101837,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}